Troubleshooting Tips
Common Issues and Solutions
Hook Job Fails to Start

Check resource quotas and limits
Verify image availability
Review RBAC permissions
Hook Execution Timeout

Increase timeout values in hook annotations
Optimize hook script execution time
Check resource constraints
Hook Weight Not Working

Ensure proper weight values (negative for pre-hooks, positive for post-hooks)
Verify hook annotations syntax
Check for conflicting weights
ConfigMap Not Available

Verify pre-install hooks completed successfully
Check hook execution order
Ensure proper dependency management
Debugging Commands
# View all hooks in a release
helm get hooks <release-name>

# Check hook execution history
kubectl describe job <hook-job-name>

# View hook pod events
kubectl get events --sort-by=.metadata.creationTimestamp

# Debug hook templates
helm template . --debug --show-only templates/hooks/
